        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n    actor SC as Sales Clerk\n    participant UI as Sales UI\n    participant SS as Sales Service\n    participant INV as Inventory Service\n    participant DB as DB\n\n    SC-&gt;&gt;UI: Enter branch, product, quantity, date\n    UI-&gt;&gt;SS: recordSale(branch, product, qty, date)\n\n    SS-&gt;&gt;INV: getBalance(branch, product)\n    INV-&gt;&gt;DB: Get branch warehouse stock\n    DB--&gt;&gt;INV: Stock balance\n    INV--&gt;&gt;SS: Stock balance\n\n    alt Quantity &lt;= balance\n        SS-&gt;&gt;INV: deductStock(branch, product, qty)\n        INV-&gt;&gt;DB: Update balance + save Stock-Out movement\n        DB--&gt;&gt;INV: Done\n        INV--&gt;&gt;SS: Stock deducted\n        SS-&gt;&gt;DB: Save sale + invoice + payment\n        DB--&gt;&gt;SS: Saved (invoice number)\n        SS--&gt;&gt;UI: Sale completed\n        UI--&gt;&gt;SC: Show \&quot;Sale completed\&quot; + invoice number\n    else Quantity &gt; balance\n        SS--&gt;&gt;UI: Rejected: insufficient stock\n        UI--&gt;&gt;SC: Show \&quot;Insufficient stock\&quot;\n    end\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null,&#xa;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;12&quot;&#xa;}" id="w2ydWZOdmf9NFkJOi5wH-1">
