        <mxCell id="c41" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=4;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#1F2D3D;fillColor=#FFF8E1;strokeColor=#D4A72C;strokeWidth=1.2;" value="&lt;b&gt;Steps 4–6 · lock first&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The source balance is read inside the transaction with a row lock, so a sale or another transfer at the same moment cannot spend the same stock (NFR-REL-02)." vertex="1">
