        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n    actor BM as Branch Manager\n    participant UI as Dead Stock UI\n    participant SVC as Dead Stock Service\n    participant DB as DB\n    participant GEM as Gemini API\n\n    BM-&gt;&gt;UI: Request dead stock suggestions\n    UI-&gt;&gt;SVC: getDeadStock(branch)\n\n    SVC-&gt;&gt;DB: Get X (idle days) from settings\n    DB--&gt;&gt;SVC: X value\n\n    SVC-&gt;&gt;DB: Get products not sold in X days (with stock balance)\n    DB--&gt;&gt;SVC: Dead stock products\n\n    alt Dead stock products found\n        SVC-&gt;&gt;DB: Get monthly sales per product per branch (last 12 months or all available) and other branches stock\n        DB--&gt;&gt;SVC: Sales history and stock levels\n\n        SVC-&gt;&gt;GEM: Analyze and decide for each product: discount or transfer (System Prompt + dead products + sales history + branches stock)\n\n        alt Gemini returned suggestions\n            GEM--&gt;&gt;SVC: Per product: Discount or Transfer to branch + reason\n            SVC--&gt;&gt;UI: Dead stock list + suggestions\n            UI--&gt;&gt;BM: Show suggestions\n        else Gemini unavailable or timeout\n            SVC--&gt;&gt;UI: Dead stock list with idle days + no recommendation available\n            UI--&gt;&gt;BM: Show list and notice\n        end\n\n    else No dead stock\n        SVC--&gt;&gt;UI: No dead stock\n        UI--&gt;&gt;BM: Show \&quot;No dead stock found\&quot;\n    end\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null,&#xa;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;12&quot;&#xa;}" id="pclQLHQGFmQz3mZCWqxP-1">
